  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 4304,
      "text": "And among His signs are the ships, sailing in the sea like mountains.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 42,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّورَىٰ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shura",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Consultation",
        "numberOfAyahs": 53,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 32,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 487,
      "ruku": 422,
      "hizbQuarter": 195,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4305,
      "text": "If He wills, He can still the wind, leaving the ships motionless on its surface. Indeed, there are signs in this for everyone who is steadfast and grateful.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 42,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّورَىٰ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shura",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Consultation",
        "numberOfAyahs": 53,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 33,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 487,
      "ruku": 422,
      "hizbQuarter": 195,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4306,
      "text": "Or He can capsize them[20] for what they committed, but He pardons much,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 42,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّورَىٰ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shura",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Consultation",
        "numberOfAyahs": 53,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 34,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 487,
      "ruku": 422,
      "hizbQuarter": 195,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4307,
      "text": "then those who dispute concerning Our signs will know that they have no escape.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 42,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّورَىٰ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shura",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Consultation",
        "numberOfAyahs": 53,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 35,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 487,
      "ruku": 422,
      "hizbQuarter": 195,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4308,
      "text": "Whatever you have been given is but a short enjoyment of the life of this world, but what is with Allah is better and more lasting for those who believe and put their trust in their Lord;",
      "surah": {
        "number": 42,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّورَىٰ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shura",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Consultation",
        "numberOfAyahs": 53,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 36,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 487,
      "ruku": 422,
      "hizbQuarter": 195,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4309,
      "text": "and those who avoid major sins and shameful deeds, and when they are angered, they forgive;",
      "surah": {
        "number": 42,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّورَىٰ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shura",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Consultation",
        "numberOfAyahs": 53,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 37,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 487,
      "ruku": 422,
      "hizbQuarter": 195,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4310,
      "text": "and those who respond to their Lord and establish prayer, and conduct their affairs by mutual consultation, and spend out of what We have provided for them;",
      "surah": {
        "number": 42,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّورَىٰ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shura",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Consultation",
        "numberOfAyahs": 53,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 38,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 487,
      "ruku": 422,
      "hizbQuarter": 195,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4311,
      "text": "and those who retaliate fairly when oppressed[21].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 42,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّورَىٰ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shura",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Consultation",
        "numberOfAyahs": 53,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 39,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 487,
      "ruku": 422,
      "hizbQuarter": 195,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4312,
      "text": "The retribution of harm is its equivalent harm, but whoever pardons and seeks reconciliation, his reward is with Allah. Indeed, He does not like the wrongdoers.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 42,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّورَىٰ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shura",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Consultation",
        "numberOfAyahs": 53,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 40,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 487,
      "ruku": 422,
      "hizbQuarter": 195,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4313,
      "text": "But whoever retaliates after being wronged, there is no blame on them.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 42,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّورَىٰ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shura",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Consultation",
        "numberOfAyahs": 53,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 41,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 487,
      "ruku": 422,
      "hizbQuarter": 195,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4314,
      "text": "Blame is only on those who wrong people and transgress in the land without right. For such there will be a painful punishment.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 42,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّورَىٰ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shura",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Consultation",
        "numberOfAyahs": 53,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 42,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 487,
      "ruku": 422,
      "hizbQuarter": 195,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4315,
      "text": "But whoever observes patience and forgives, it is indeed a matter of great resolve[22].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 42,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّورَىٰ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shura",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Consultation",
        "numberOfAyahs": 53,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 43,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 487,
      "ruku": 422,
      "hizbQuarter": 195,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4316,
      "text": "Whoever Allah causes to stray, he will have no protector thereafter. You will see the wrongdoers, when they see the punishment, saying, “Is there any way to go back?”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 42,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّورَىٰ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shura",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Consultation",
        "numberOfAyahs": 53,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
